<title>UK: Lehman names new director for French derivatives.</title>
<headline>Lehman names new director for French derivatives.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment house Lehman Brothers said on Thursday it had appointed Aubin Thomine-Desmazures as a director in fixed income derivative sales.</p>
<p>Desmazures, who joins from Natwest Markets, will be responsible for derivative sales coverage of French institutions.</p>
<p>He will report jointly to Lehman's executive director for European derivative sales and the head of fixed income in Paris.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
